From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 06:37:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 133/133] dynarmic A64: the flags look-ahead's
 B.cond/CBZ/CBNZ/TBZ/TBNZ targets without the bits under the immediate

The look-ahead took a conditional branch's target as s32(inst << 8) >> 11 (TBZ: << 13 >> 16):
the two bits under the immediate came along into the target's low bits, the condition's
(B.cond with HI and above) or the register's (CBZ, TBZ). It then read the code 1 to 3 bytes off,
decoded whatever that was, and could take the flags for dead where the real target reads them (a
stale C for an ADC in a gen8 program, 1 of 1,290 in the 04.28 sweep). Now the immediate is shifted
down whole and times 4. In 04.23-04.27 (patch 0119).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01REmpC53sSK3VTcKMxWFSSb
---
 .../src/dynarmic/frontend/A64/translate/a64_translate.cpp | 8 +++++---
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/dynarmic/src/dynarmic/frontend/A64/translate/a64_translate.cpp b/src/dynarmic/src/dynarmic/frontend/A64/translate/a64_translate.cpp
index f128a35d16..1a9eea5afb 100644
--- a/src/dynarmic/src/dynarmic/frontend/A64/translate/a64_translate.cpp
+++ b/src/dynarmic/src/dynarmic/frontend/A64/translate/a64_translate.cpp
@@ -163,14 +163,16 @@ struct FlagsLookahead {
                 }
                 u64 target = 0;
                 bool branch = true;
+                // (the immediate shifted down whole, then times 4: the bits under it, the condition or
+                // the register, must not come along; 04.23-04.28 had them in the target's low bits)
                 if ((inst & 0xFF000010) == 0x54000000) {  // B.cond
                     if (FlagsReadByCond(inst & 0xF) & unset)
                         return true;
-                    target = pc + u64(s64(s32(inst << 8) >> 11));
+                    target = pc + (u64(s64(s32(inst << 8) >> 13)) << 2);
                 } else if ((inst & 0x7E000000) == 0x34000000) {  // CBZ, CBNZ
-                    target = pc + u64(s64(s32(inst << 8) >> 11));
+                    target = pc + (u64(s64(s32(inst << 8) >> 13)) << 2);
                 } else if ((inst & 0x7E000000) == 0x36000000) {  // TBZ, TBNZ
-                    target = pc + u64(s64(s32(inst << 13) >> 16));
+                    target = pc + (u64(s64(s32(inst << 13) >> 18)) << 2);
                 } else if ((inst & 0xFE000000) == 0xD6000000) {  // through a register
                     if (abi && (IsCall(inst) || IsReturn(inst)))
                         return false;
